Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好是一分五十二秒 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly 1 minute 52 seconds. That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《007系列之俄罗斯之恋》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(威尼斯国际象棋圣手锦标赛)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马吃象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knight takes bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马吃象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knight takes bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(马上要召见你)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王走向车二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King to rook two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王走向车二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King to rook two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王后走到王四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen to king four.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王后走到王四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen to king four.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你 很杰出的一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My congratulations, sir. A brilliant coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暹罗斗鱼 迷人的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Siamese fighting fish. Fascinating creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勇敢 但总括来说 很笨 对 他们很笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brave, but, on the whole, stupid. Yes, they're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了是这里的一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for the occasional one, such as we have here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让其他两条自相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who lets the other two fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己则静心等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he waits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到活下来的那条筋疲力尽 无法自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waits until the survivor is so exhausted that he cannot defend himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后 跟幽灵一样 他就出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, like SPECTRE, he strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种相似之处十分有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find the parallel amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,组织安排你从俄国远道而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our organisation did not arrange for you to come over from the Russians
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:08:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并非是为了享乐的 三号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just for amusement, Number Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧 克朗斯汀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Kronsteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下吧 三号 我们听听 五号的计策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Number Three, while we listen to what Number Five has devised for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望策划科主管克朗斯汀的成就 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope his efforts as director of planning continue...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会像他在西洋棋的成就般卓越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be as successful as his chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据你的指示 我为幽灵党计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you instructed, I've planned for SPECTRE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从俄国偷取新式的列克托解码器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to steal from the Russians their new Lektor decoding machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为此我们需要俄国密码部 一位驻土耳其的女成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this we need the services of the Russian Cryptograph Section in Turkey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及英国情报机构的协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the help of the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 英俄双方都不会知道 他们是在替我们工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither the Russians nor the British will be aware that they are working for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三号 你的部门准备好 执行克朗斯汀的指令了没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Three, is your section ready to carry out the directives?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了 我们会根据他的计划 组织行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the operation will be organised according to Kronsteen's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从伊斯坦堡的俄国领事馆中 挑选了适当人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have selected a girl from the Russian Consulate in Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她既能干 又合作 对国家忠心耿耿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's capable, cooperative, and her loyalty to the state is beyond question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:10:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定她相信你仍然是 苏联情报机关的行动组首脑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sure she believes you're still head of operations for Soviet Intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不可能会知道 我已经加入了幽灵党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's most unlikely she would know I'm now working for SPECTRE.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫斯科严守着我脱党的秘密 只有主席团的小数成员知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow has kept my defection secret from everyone but the presidium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你着想 但愿如此吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your sake, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克朗斯汀 你确定这个计划万无一失?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kronsteen, you're sure this plan is foolproof?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我已经考虑到对方的 对抗手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, because I have anticipated every possible variation of countermove.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何以见得英国情报机构的首领 M \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what makes you think that M...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会同意你的计划 并出手相助?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will oblige you by falling in with your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这明显是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the simple reason that this is so obviously a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为英国人的心理就是 视陷阱为挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My reading of the British mentality is that they always treat a trap as a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 他们都不会放过 任何一个得到解码器的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they couldn't possibly pass up the chance of getting the Lektor decoder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一直希望能得到一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have wanted one for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的都可能是事实 还有呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that you say could be true. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 幽灵党也许有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SPECTRE will probably have the chance of a personal revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为诺博士的死报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the killing of our operative Dr No,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:11:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于这种任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the man the British will almost certainly use on a mission of this sort
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国肯定会派詹姆斯邦德来应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be their agent, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他死前 尽情折磨他 让他受尽侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let his death be a particularly unpleasant and humiliating one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我要马上将计划付诸行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'll put my plan into operation straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不会失败的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be no failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到幽灵岛 我们很荣幸 希望你的旅途愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to SPECTRE Island. I hope you had a pleasant flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间有限 我需要的人准备好了没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time is limited. Is the man I requested ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的档案  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His dossier. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"唐纳德葛兰 杀人犯"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donald Grant, convicted murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"1960年越狱，1962年招募于谭吉尔"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escaped Dartmoor Prison in 1960, recruited in Tangier in 1962.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 他人在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在湖边 把他带到我的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the lake. Bring him to my office, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我到湖边去 穿过训练区就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me to the lake. Through the training area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,葛兰是精英份子之一 嗜杀成狂 是一流人才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grant's one of our best men. Homicidal paranoiac, superb material.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然手法比较残忍 但是他对训练和教化 都有卓越的反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His response to our training and indoctrination have been remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你认可我们这里的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope our work here meets with your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,训练是有帮助 但是实战经验才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Training is useful, but there is no substitute for experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意 我们也有用活人靶子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree. We use live targets as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫他来  葛兰!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call him. Grant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:14:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他蛮强壮的 要他在一天内 到伊斯坦堡向我报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems fit enough. Have him report to me in Istanbul in 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(总领事馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[俄罗斯语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}[ Russian ]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[土耳其语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}[ Turkish ]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国家安全局下士 塔坦妮雅罗曼诺娃报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corporal of State Security Tatiana Romanova.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱普上校 情报科行动科首领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Klebb, head of operations for SMERSH.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在莫斯科英国解码室工作时 曾见过你一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you once in Moscow, when I worked for the English decoding room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有跟领事馆的人提到 你来这里的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you tell anyone you were coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 电报上说 我知道 是我发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the message... Yes, yes, I know. I sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的工作记录很杰出 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your work record is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国家以你为荣 谢谢你 上校同志  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The state is proud of you. Thank you, Comrade Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把夹克脱下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转个圈圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很漂亮 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a fine-looking girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾受芭蕾舞训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you trained for the ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我比规定的高度高了一寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I grew an inch over the regulation height, and so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经有三个情人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you have had three lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛要问这些私人问题呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the purpose of such an intimate question?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里不是要发问 你忘了自己在跟谁说话!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not here to ask questions. You forget to whom you are speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我在恋爱 若你不是在恋爱呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in love. And if you were not in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这得看男方是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose that would depend on the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答得很明智 例如是这个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensible answer. This man, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 若他既体贴又文明 我也许愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot tell. Perhaps if he was kind and kulturny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挑选了你进行一次重要任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corporal, I have selected you for a most important assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目的在向敌人发放假消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its purpose is to give false information to the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你成功 可获擢升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you complete it successfully, you will be promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始 你要对他言听计从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, you will do anything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我拒绝呢? 你休想活着离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I refuse? Then you will not leave this room alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我服从你的命令 好 这是你的指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will obey your orders. Good. Now, these are your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到这里来向我报到 然而领事馆的人不可以知道我在伊斯坦堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You report to me here, but the consulate security man must not know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次任务远超他的职责范围 我会守口如瓶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is classified far above his level. I will say nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你敢多言 我会毙了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do, you will be shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很幸运 能获选执行这件简单轻松的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very fortunate to have been chosen for such a simple, delightful duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是我们说的爱情特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A real labour of love, as we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自俄罗斯的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"From Russia With Love" 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是好运动 你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great sport, this. What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说划艇是很好的运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said it's great sport, this punting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对同意 我也许会为此而放弃高尔夫球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't agree with him more. I may even give up golf for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是别的醋坛子留下的战绩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Souvenir from another jealous woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此后我从没对女人掉头不顾过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But I haven't turned my back on one since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,衬衫给我 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my shirt. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要打电话 但是我们还没吃饭呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to make a phone call. But we haven't eaten yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饿坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧 我是邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Univex. James Bond here. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他整个早上都在找你 你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been asking for you all morning. Where in the world are you, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在重温一件旧案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've just been reviewing an old case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:19:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我成了旧案子吗?  是公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm an old case now, am I? It's the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他说我在回来途中 他才不是呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him I'm on my way, will you? He is not on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听话 我们改天再聚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sylvia, behave. We'll do this again some other time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聚什么?你上次这样说过后 就到了牙买加了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what? Last time you said that, you went off to Jamaica.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已半年没见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen you for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一小时后回来 我会告诉他的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there in an hour. I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的旧案子很有趣呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Your old case sounds interesting, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个半小时后才到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, about that lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个奇迹就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For my next miracle, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若他能解释今天往哪跑了才是奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be a miracle if he can explain where he's been all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没听过塔坦妮雅罗曼诺娃这个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've never even heard of a Tatiana Romanova.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很荒谬吧 简直是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ridiculous, isn't it? It's absolutely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子的确会爱上明星照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, girls do fall in love with pictures of film stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是俄国的密码员 不应该爱上英国特工的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not a Russian cipher clerk with a file photo of a British agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非她是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless she's mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这是陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's some sort of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 这是陷阱 诱饵就是全新的列克托密码机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously it's a trap, and the bait is a cipher machine, a brand-new Lektor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中央情报局已经找了它一年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Lektor, no less. The CIA's been after one of those for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, so have we.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跟土耳其T分局的头目 克林贝接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she contacted Kerim Bey, head of Station T in Turkey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说要脱党 并愿意把解码器交给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and told him she wanted to defect, she said she'd turn it over to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要到伊斯坦堡去 护送她和解码器回英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you went out to Istanbul and brought her and the machine back to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是克林给她拍的快照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a snapshot Kerim managed to get of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我对密码学的了解不深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know too much about cryptography,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是列克托可以解开他们的绝密信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a Lektor could decode their top secret signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整件事实在太难以置信了 很有可能是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole thing's so fantastic it just could be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That had occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近俄国人没耍什么花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, the Russians haven't been up to any tricks recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近我比较清闲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, really, I'm not too busy at the moment, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上八点半的机位已经替你订好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're booked on the 8.30 plane in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要错过任何可以取到解码器的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's any chance of us getting a Lektor, we must look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若她跟我见面时 我不符合她的要求呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose when she meets me in the flesh I don't come up to expectations?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须达到她的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just see that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班霓小姐 请装备员进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Moneypenny, ask the equipment officer to come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q装配了一个很帅气的行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q Branch has put together a smart-Iooking piece of luggage for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有编号00的人员 都会被分派到一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're issuing this to all double-0 personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个普通的黑色皮箱 两边分别拥有二十发弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ordinary black leather case with 20 rounds of ammunition here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把顶端挪开 就会看见弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you take the top off, you'll find the ammunition inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边有一柄平伸的匕首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the side here, a flat throwing knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按下这个按钮就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press that button there, and out she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,箱子内备有AR7可折叠的狙击手来福枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside the case, you'll find an AR7 folding sniper's rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,点25口径 配备红外线望远镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.25 calibre, with an infrared telescopic sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条带子藏有五十个一镑金币 每边二十五个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, if you pull out these straps, inside are 50 gold sovereigns, 25 in either side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心看清楚 这是一罐滑石粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, watch very carefully. An ordinary tin of talcum powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面其实是催泪弹 它这样黏着箱子旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside, a tear-gas cartridge. That goes in the case against the side here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有磁性 不会掉下来 关上箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's magnetised, so it won't fall. Shut the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般来说 要打开箱子 你把钩子往两边推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normally, to open a case like that, you move the catches to the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样催泪弹就会在你面前爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do, the cartridge will explode in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.17,0:22:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了防止爆炸 将钩子横移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, to stop the cartridge exploding, turn the catches horizontally, like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.59,0:22:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后按照惯例打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, open normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:22:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.22,0:23:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钩子这样转  对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn the catches like that. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后按照惯例打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And open ordinarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗?  应该明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it? Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.23,0:23:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的事了吧?  没有了 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all, sir? Yes, thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份圣诞礼物真厉害 不过我用不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty little Christmas present. But I shouldn't need it on this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.07,0:23:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着他上路吧 祝你好运 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the same, take it with you. Good luck, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"再次深入虎穴了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Once more unto the breach, dear friends."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一张机票 你真走运 我从没到过伊期坦堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one plane ticket. Lucky man. I've never been to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没到过伊期坦堡? 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never been to Istanbul? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里 博斯普鲁斯的月色令人陶醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the moonlight on the Bosphorus is irresistible?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有天我会让你带我去 我已经试过其他一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should get you to take me there someday. I've tried everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的钱班霓 我对其他女人不屑一顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling Moneypenny, you know I never even look at another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我把世界的奥秘告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you the secret of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班霓小姐 叫007把照片留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Moneypenny, ask 007 to leave the photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.99,0:24:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定可以把那位女士认出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he'll recognise the lady when he sees her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.66,0:24:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(带着爱意来的苏俄人)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.88,0:24:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck. Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.39,0:24:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伦敦 你的飞机刚抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, London. Your flight PA1 just landed Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.07,0:24:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝派了车来接你 好 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim Bey sent a car for you, sir. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以借一根火柴用吗? 我用打火机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I borrow a match? I use a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就更好了 直到它们坏掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's better still. Until they go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:25:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点不错 我去开车来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. I'll get the car, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝建议你到饭店前 先跟他见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim Bey suggested that you see him before going to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你方便吗?  好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would that be convenient? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让别人跟踪是这里的惯例吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it's customary to have people tailing you in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 今天值班的是雪铁龙H31854\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today it's Citroen H31854 on duty. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是替俄国人办事的保加利亚人 我们互相跟踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bulgarians working for the Russians. They follow us, we follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家互有默契 那真友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a sort of understanding we have. That's very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, my friend, come in, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴看见你 欢迎来到伊斯坦堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad to see you. Welcome to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.29,0:27:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的车子 但这把我们两个连系起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for sending the car. But it does rather tie you in with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.55,0:27:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是巴尔干半岛 跟俄国人玩游戏的方式有点不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the Balkans now. The game with the Russians is played differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.63,0:27:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在日常事务方面 互相派车辆跟踪对方并不困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For routine matters, we don't make it too difficult to keep a tab on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的司机已经跟我说了 这个年轻人蛮聪明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I gathered from your chauffeur. He's a rather intelligent young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是应该的 他是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should be. He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要咖啡吗? 不太甜也不太苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coffee? Medium sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.15,0:27:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要两杯 不太甜也不太苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two medium sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also is my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有主要雇员都是我儿子 家族关系是这行的最佳保障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my key employees are my sons. Blood is the best security in this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.91,0:27:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里的事业一定很庞大 雇员数目为全土耳其之冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have quite an establishment. Biggest family payroll in Turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.49,0:28:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对一个马戏团的前杂技人来说 算是不俗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for a man who used to break chains and bend bars in a circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如谈谈你的事业 M认为我是在浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let's talk about your business. M thinks I'm wasting my time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这样想 我这个老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so do I. This is an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗅出有状况了 也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it tells me something smells. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.55,0:28:16.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是若有机会获得列克托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if there's a chance of getting a Lektor...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.51,0:28:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪可以跟这女孩联络?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you tell me. Where can I contact this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说她会自行安排 你得耐心等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she would make her own arrangements. You'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.23,0:28:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 若你真的要听我的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend, if you really want my advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该在伊斯坦堡欢度几天 然后回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should spend a few pleasant days with us here in Istanbul, then go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.35,0:29:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯邦德 我预留了房间的 已经准备好了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond, I have a reservation. Your room is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.60,0:29:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,32号房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.90,0:29:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生的32号房  希望你满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}32 for Mr Bond. Hope you enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.19,0:29:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.01,0:29:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他吩咐吗?  只有这个 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will there be anything else, sir? Only this. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.68,0:29:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是邦德 这间房子不太适合 很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Bond here. I'm afraid the room won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.67,0:31:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,床太小了 请等等 你听到了没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bed's too small. One moment, sir. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他房间都满了 只剩下结婚套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him that's all there is. Unless he would like the bridal suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.51,0:31:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 没有空房了 除了结婚套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir. That's all we have available, except the bridal suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.85,0:31:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看 也许我会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's have a look at it. I may like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.97,0:31:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服务员会带你看看 他马上就上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The porter will show it to you. He will be up immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.44,0:31:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.85,0:32:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 俄国不怀疑英国还会怀疑谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work. Who can the Russians suspect but the British?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.02,0:32:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯坦堡的冷战 很快就会炽热起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cold War in Istanbul will not remain cold very much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.75,0:32:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ali Kerim Bey...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.34,0:32:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ali Kerim Bey. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ali Kerim Bey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.78,0:33:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早见到我不高兴吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not glad to see me this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大喜过望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也无法取悦你了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I no longer please you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.67,0:33:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要回到做苦工的地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the salt mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心处理那些文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful with those papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.79,0:34:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁赢了?  我有客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who won? I had visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外墙装有计时的水下爆破弹 要把书桌前的我轰掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Limpet mine on the wall outside. Timed to catch me at my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.09,0:34:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我在沙发上休息了几分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, by good fortune, I was relaxing on the settee for a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.09,0:34:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩歇斯底里地离开了 她觉得你太暴力了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl left in hysterics. Found your technique too violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂为何要破坏休战协定 俄国人不像会这样破坏和平的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't understand this sudden breach of the truce. It's unlike the Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太鲁莽了 这该跟我的到访有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most inconsiderate. My visit might have something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.23,0:34:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看找出原因吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close up afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.70,0:34:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的环境很不错呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.12,0:34:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1600年前 君士坦丁皇 兴建了这个水库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Emperor Constantine built it as a reservoir 1600 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.04,0:34:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.63,0:34:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.57,0:35:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我每天的运动 早上十一点和下午三点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daily exercise: At eleven in the morning and three in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.78,0:35:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它绑起来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tie her up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.09,0:35:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind your head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.14,0:35:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在俄国领事馆下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underneath the Russian Consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.97,0:36:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是英国海军送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A present from your navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.44,0:36:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公共事务部进行勘察时 我们的朋友就被解雇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our friends were turned out by the Public Works Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.86,0:36:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为繁忙的交通把地基动摇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story was that the heavy traffic was shaking the foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.61,0:36:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证实安全后 我就把这个装上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time the place was declared safe, I had this installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.11,0:36:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M说你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see everything M said about you is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.70,0:36:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我干嘛要留在这行业?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why I stay in this mad business?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.41,0:36:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为卖地毯很苦闷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be that you find selling rugs a bore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.25,0:36:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 你真是深知我心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend, you should be a mind-reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.63,0:36:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主持者是军事情报机构主管 维斯里将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head of the table is General Vassili, director of Military Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.92,0:36:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左边的是安全局主任 科斯洛夫斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On his left: Koslovski, Chief of Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.47,0:36:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对面的是俄国特工宝士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opposite him: Benz, one of his agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不清另一个男人的面貌 那个在挨骂的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see the face of the other man, the one the general is shouting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.19,0:36:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他因为某些事而把那个人骂个狗血淋头 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's giving him a hell of a blowing up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.07,0:36:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜我们听不到谈话的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad we can't hear as well as see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.82,0:36:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼诺娃会进入这个房间吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me. Does our girl Romanova ever come to this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.74,0:37:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有时会把消息带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, with messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.41,0:37:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见另一个男人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see the face of the other man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.83,0:37:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是柯里兰库!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krilencu.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.95,0:37:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回来了 另一个保加利亚杀人狂魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's back. Another Bulgarian they use as a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.88,0:37:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸弹就是他放置的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the man for the limpet mine job.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从前跟他有过节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had trouble with him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.13,0:37:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他离开伊斯坦堡已经一年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's stayed out of Istanbul for over a year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.93,0:37:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看一下 你应该记得他的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look. You should remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.89,0:37:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这厮以杀人为乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man kills for pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.02,0:37:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很帅呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.56,0:37:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 有个女孩进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a moment. A girl's just come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.61,0:37:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是罗曼诺娃 只有她才可以进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably Romanova. She's the only one who's allowed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的样貌如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does she look to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.61,0:37:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这个角度看来 身材很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From this angle, things are shaping up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.33,0:37:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要见她的本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to see her in the flesh. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以把这里的平面图给我吗?  我也希望可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you get me a plan of that place? I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.55,0:38:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有地方注册了这里的图样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there must be the original drawing somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.30,0:38:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替你接洽吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get onto that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.10,0:38:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一点时间应付柯里兰库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I need a little time to deal with this stinking Krilencu.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.64,0:38:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚最好不要待在饭店里 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be better if you didn't stay at the hotel tonight. Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.74,0:38:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你干嘛要留着劳斯莱斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see now why you keep the Rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.36,0:38:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我其中一个儿子驾着它 后座坐着两个假人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my sons is driving it. With two dummies in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往相反方向驶去 他们会跟上好几小时呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the opposite direction. They'll follow it for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.71,0:38:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢我的吉普赛朋友的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll like my Gypsy friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.29,0:38:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我利用他们 就像俄国人 利用保加利亚人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I use them like the Russians the Bulgars. It's created a blood feud between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.02,0:39:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柯里兰库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Krilencu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.07,0:39:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[俄罗斯语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}[ Russian ]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.83,0:39:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[俄罗斯语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}[ Russian ]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.83,0:39:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来得不合时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems we've come on the wrong night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.50,0:39:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两女爱上一男 要把对方除掉 一定要以吉普赛的方式解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two girls in love with the same man have threatened to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.17,0:39:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他们的老朋友 可以留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I'm an old friend of the family, we can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.72,0:39:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们请我们入席 希望你会用手吃饭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're bidden to table. I hope you are good at eating with your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.05,0:39:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim Bey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.02,0:39:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是很名贵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raki. Filthy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.93,0:41:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.11,0:42:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟主人说他的招待实在太慇勤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell our host his hospitality overwhelms me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.91,0:42:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.59,0:42:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样 什么都别说 什么都别做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens now, say and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.39,0:42:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说可否化干戈为玉帛 停止争斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's asking whether they will cease their blood feud.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.69,0:42:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让长老们决定谁可嫁给族长之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elders of the tribe will then decide who will marry the chief's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.32,0:43:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说  你不用解说我也猜到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's saying... I think I got it without the subtitles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.64,0:45:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.93,0:46:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到柯里兰库了没? 还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get Krilencu? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.77,0:46:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 拿来 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute. Here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.52,0:46:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打得很好 我只是个糟老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fought well. I am nothing but a clumsy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.78,0:46:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在向保加利亚伤者逼供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're making one of the wounded Bulgars talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.49,0:46:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是冲着我而来的 干嘛要除掉我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was me they were after. Why would they want me out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.74,0:47:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们得找到柯里兰库的巢穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow we will have to find Krilencu's hide-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.29,0:47:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名贵的东西就由我来摆平吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meantime, I'll take care of this filthy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.00,0:47:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华拉感谢你救了他一命 你是他的儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vavra thanks you for saving his life. You are now his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.39,0:47:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.35,0:47:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想请求他阻止那些女孩打斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to ask him a favour. Could he stop the girl fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.56,0:47:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你太心软 不能做真正吉普赛人 不过他会让你决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your heart is too soft to be a real Gypsy. But he lets you decide the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.07,0:47:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我的麻烦还不够多似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if I didn't have enough problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.75,0:47:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华拉说由你来决定 你决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vavra said for you to decide. So decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.63,0:48:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们都是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're both yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.05,0:48:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可需要花点时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.13,0:48:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有到饭店替我收拾行李呢? 在座位上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you pick up the package? It's on the seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.34,0:48:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.65,0:49:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柯里兰库曾两次要干掉我 下次他会成功的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twice that Krilencu has tried to kill me. The third time he will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.78,0:49:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我先下手为强 我今晚就动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless I get him first. And that I'll do tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.66,0:49:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手伤了 不行 让我摆平他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not with that arm, you won't. You'd better leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.28,0:49:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你的已经够多了 朋友之间说什么亏欠呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already too much in your debt. How can a friend be in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.84,0:49:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.43,0:49:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红外线望远镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Infrared lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.30,0:49:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.96,0:50:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.46,0:50:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会去按他的电铃 他有一个秘密的逃生天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will ring his doorbell. He has a private escape hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.68,0:50:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这里来瞄准吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try this for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.81,0:50:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗?  还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you notice anything? Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.52,0:50:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个安妮塔的小嘴很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has a lovely mouth, that Anita.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.23,0:50:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I see what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.36,0:50:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管有没有受伤 我都得亲自开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm or no arm, I have to pull that trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.57,0:50:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你觉得可以的话 记着 你只有一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think you can. You've got one shot, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.99,0:50:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.88,0:51:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.77,0:51:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.81,0:51:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.03,0:51:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯平了很多债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That pays many debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.03,0:51:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该把嘴巴闭起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She should have kept her mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.73,0:52:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.77,0:52:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九点的时候 请送一人份的早餐上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breakfast for one at nine please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.61,0:52:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无花果、优酪乳、黑咖啡 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green figs, yoghurt, coffee very black. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.89,0:53:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看来很惊讶 我还以为你在等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look surprised. I thought you were expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.52,0:53:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是塔坦妮雅罗曼诺娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you are Tatiana Romanova?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.86,0:53:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友叫我坦妮雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends call me Tania.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.65,0:53:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友叫我做詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine call me James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.24,0:53:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们已正式介绍过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now that we've been properly introduced...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.66,0:53:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心 我害怕手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful. Guns upset me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.41,0:53:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm a bit upset myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:54:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟照片一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look just like your... your photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.04,0:54:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过最漂亮的女孩之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of the most beautiful girls ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.59,0:54:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 不过我的嘴巴太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, but I think my mouth is too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.59,0:54:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大小刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's the right size.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.05,0:54:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.10,0:54:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.23,0:54:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在这里吗?  什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it here? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.61,0:54:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,列克托解码器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decoding machine. Lektor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.15,0:54:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要现在说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must we talk about it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.86,0:54:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是在俄国领事馆里呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it at the Russian Consulate?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.24,0:54:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.41,0:54:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要那个地方的平面图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes... I would need a plan of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.17,0:54:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你拿到的话 我们就装成游客 在圣索非亚清真寺见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could get one, we could meet at the Saint Sophia mosque as tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.50,0:54:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不晚一点才说呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you ask me that later?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.80,0:54:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在找什么? 那道疤痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what are you looking for? The scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.55,0:55:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你的档案中 我对你了若指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? I know all about you from your file.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.56,0:55:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗? 希望我不会让你失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do? Well, I hope you're not disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.02,0:55:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到天亮时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.44,0:55:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.66,0:56:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来到了 圣索非亚最有趣的角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are now approaching the most interesting corner of Saint Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.12,0:56:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两条斑岩巨柱 是从埃及偷运进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including these two great red porphyry columns, stolen and brought from Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.42,0:56:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在巨柱之前的 雪花石膏瓮是从贝尔加马带回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In front of them, alabaster urn was brought from Bergama,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.71,0:56:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个历史名城 位于斯麦纳的附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a famous historical city near Smyrna.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.13,0:56:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其源头追溯至 亚历山大大帝的年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It dates back from the Alexander the Great period.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.10,0:56:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概在1648年苏丹穆纳特四世 把它从贝尔加马带回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 1648 Sultan Murad IV brought it from Bergama.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.77,0:56:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前那是一个沐浴仪式用的喷泉 可以盛载一千升清水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was used as an ablution fountain. It contains a thousand litres of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.82,0:56:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在沐浴泉后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right after the ablution fountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.70,0:56:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来到一条非常有趣的圆柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are going to a highly interesting column over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:57:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数个世纪以来 它被称为圣索非亚许愿柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}known for centuries as the Saint Sophia wishing column.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.63,0:57:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成千上万的人们 来这里许愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tens of thousands of people have wished here,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.01,0:57:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把右手的中指 放到柱洞中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}putting their right hand and middle finger in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.25,0:58:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(讯号室 总办公室)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.50,0:58:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保证 他不是我的手下干掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you it wasn't one of my men who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.34,0:58:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他并非死于自然 但却省了我不少工夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't die of old age. All I know is that it saved me the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.67,0:58:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一见到那女人 她已很明显的妥协了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once he'd seen the girl, she was compromised, and so...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.26,0:58:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这并非他的死因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he wasn't killed because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.01,0:58:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样说吧 伊斯坦堡是个暴力城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say that Istanbul's a rough town.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.60,0:58:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看坦妮雅的领事馆地图 跟你的平面图是否吻合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how Tania's map compares with your architect's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.27,0:59:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是俄国领事馆的会议室 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is conference room of the Russian Consulate. That checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.03,0:59:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是通讯室 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this here is the communication room. That's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.99,0:59:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她每天二点至三点使用解码器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she says she works there with the Lektor between two and three.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.78,0:59:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她如何把解码器弄给我们? 她由我决定 她对我言听计从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is she gonna get the machine to us? She'll do anything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.50,0:59:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都会做吗? 亲爱的詹姆斯 你没动过脑筋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything. My dear James, you're not using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.88,0:59:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来实在是太容易了 我们甚至不知道她有没有说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all sounds too easy. We don't even know if she's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.34,0:59:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算找出真相 在哪? 在饭店里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to find out. Where? In the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.38,0:59:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会再到那里去 她说太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. She won't go there again. She says it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.59,0:59:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老掉牙的手段 先让你尝尝甜头 吊你的胃口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old game. Give a wolf a taste, then keep him hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.22,0:59:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 她使你神魂颠倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend, she's got you dangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.85,0:59:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.56,0:59:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只想要解码器 - 只想?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All I want is that Lektor. - All?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.90,0:59:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的只想要解码器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure that's all you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.98,1:00:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风景真优美  我们必须马上离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely view. James, we must leave here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.99,1:00:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若那个特工揭发我跟你见面  别担心 他不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that agent reports my meeting you... Don't worry. He won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.12,1:00:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白 这样很危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't understand the danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.87,1:00:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 看 笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, look up. Smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.38,1:00:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拍一张 往后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one. Further back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.22,1:01:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那部机器 你关心的只是它 不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the machine... That's all you are interested in. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.31,1:01:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先谈公事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Business first.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.31,1:01:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 当你得到它之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, once you have got what you want...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.94,1:01:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't got it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.06,1:01:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但若你把机器的事告诉我 之后我们不见得要在办公时间内合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, afterwards, we won't always be working on the company's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.19,1:01:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要知道什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.82,1:01:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对着它回答问题 悄悄说 但要清楚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk into this. Answer my questions quietly, but clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.04,1:01:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那部机器有多大呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How large is the machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.87,1:01:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像一部打字机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like... like a typewriter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.34,1:01:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多重?  大概十公斤吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weight? About ten kilos.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.26,1:01:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在褐色箱子内 就像你的眼睛般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a brown case. Brown like your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只谈公事 是自动校准还是用手操作的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it technical. Self-calibrating or manual?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.18,1:01:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两样都有 内置补助器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both, with an in-built compensator.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.10,1:01:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不可以 现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, couldn't we... Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.73,1:02:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟照相机说 有多少个键?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk into the camera. How many keys?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.07,1:02:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,符号键还是密码键呢? 两样都要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Symbol or code keys? Both.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24个符号键 16个密码键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 24 symbols and 16 code keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.74,1:02:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它插进狭长孔里 译本就会印在纸卷上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is inserted in a slot and the message comes out in a paper roll
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.87,1:02:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会从另一边的狭长孔里出来 它的结构是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from another slot on the other side. The mechanism is...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.62,1:02:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 到英国后 我们会不断做爱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, James, James, will you make love to me all the time in England?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.75,1:02:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日以继夜都会 继续说它的结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day and night. Go on about the mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.59,1:02:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, the mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.92,1:02:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一次它进行维修时 我看过里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, when it was being repaired, I saw the insides.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.59,1:02:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有很多穿孔的 我猜是铜片 有一小灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were many perforated discs, made I think of copper, with a small light.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.72,1:02:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坦白告诉我 我跟那些西方女孩一样刺激吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dushka, tell me the truth, am I as exciting as all those Western girls?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.44,1:02:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一次我跟M在东京 经历了一次有趣的体验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, when I was with M in Tokyo, we had an interesting experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.57,1:02:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 钱班霓 这样可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Miss Moneypenny. That's all, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.53,1:02:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later, later.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.70,1:03:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些铜片和小灯 小灯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those copper discs and the light... Oh, the light, the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.87,1:03:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 靠近我 我有些话要私下告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, come closer. I want to whisper something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.91,1:03:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续吧 不是这样 说结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. No, not that. The mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.17,1:03:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班霓小姐 我知道你在听着的 请你记下这个电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Moneypenny, as you're no doubt listening, perhaps you'd take this cable?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.84,1:03:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内容是:"货品是真的 停 继续进行交易 M上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Merchandise appears genuine. Stop. Go ahead with deal. Signed, M. "
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.39,1:03:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要把日期告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all I have to do is to tell the girl the date.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.31,1:03:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十三号吗? 是十四号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 13th? The 14th.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.62,1:03:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,签证?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visas?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.20,1:03:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,签证? 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visas? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.59,1:04:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来申请签证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visa, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.13,1:04:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的钟准确吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your clock, is it correct?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一向都很准确 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.99,1:04:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 你说你的钟准确吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. You did say your clock was correct?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.32,1:04:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俄罗斯的钟一向都很准确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russian clocks are always...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.23,1:05:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是列克托吗? 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the Lektor? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.27,1:05:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴上它 不过是催泪气而已 我还以为明天才行动呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this. It thought it was for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.07,1:05:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是十三号 现在谈迷信真不是个好时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today is the 13th, isn't it? It's a hell of a time to be superstitious.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.91,1:05:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.43,1:05:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别抬头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.44,1:05:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argh!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.69,1:05:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.99,1:05:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边走 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.08,1:06:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?  是俄国特工宝士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Benz, the Russian security man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.38,1:07:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.92,1:07:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.10,1:07:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[俄罗斯语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}[ Russian ]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.07,1:07:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是其中一间 那是另一间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's one of them. And there's the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.92,1:07:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的护照 照片跟真人并不吻合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your passports. The pictures do not do you justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.13,1:07:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很少有这么漂亮的夫妇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have rarely seen a handsomer couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.18,1:07:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大卫索美赛伉俪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr and Mrs David Somerset.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.93,1:07:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫凯罗琳 凯罗琳 我喜欢这个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name's Caroline. Caroline. I like that name.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.10,1:07:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你陪我到德贝夏出差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're accompanying me on a business trip on our way home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.02,1:08:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去探孩子吗? 没有孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To our children? No children.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.48,1:08:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连儿子都没有? 没有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even one little boy? Nyet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.61,1:08:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢大家庭 我这生都在大家庭度过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like big families. My whole life has been a crusade for larger families.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.73,1:08:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 坦妮雅 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I heard. Tania? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.53,1:08:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门锁上 我会敲门三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the door locked. I'll knock three times.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.91,1:08:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.58,1:08:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去跟车长见面  你确定他会合作吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go see the conductor. You're sure he'll cooperate?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.62,1:08:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前我们曾经有交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done business before.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.79,1:08:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会在保加利亚边境停下 我儿子会开车接我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll stop the train near the frontier, where my sons will be waiting with a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六点整到 小型机场在哪? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be there about six o'clock. And the airstrip?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.09,1:08:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二十里之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.60,1:08:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是飞往雅典的包机 你明天就会抵达伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plane is chartered to Athens. You'll be in London tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.27,1:08:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到伦敦后为此而干杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll drink to that in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.77,1:08:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的要到英国去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we are really on our way to England.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.95,1:09:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两天是我们的蜜月期呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, with a lovely two-day honeymoon before us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.57,1:09:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜜月?我没有衣服穿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honeymoon? And I've nothing to wear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.33,1:09:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的嫁妆 哦 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your trousseau. Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.79,1:09:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.55,1:09:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 哦 哦 詹姆斯 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Oh, no. James, James!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.51,1:09:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.19,1:09:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.16,1:09:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会在皮卡迪利大道穿这裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will wear this one in Piccadilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.66,1:09:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 他们刚通过了新法例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't. They've just passed some new laws there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.97,1:10:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比较近 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nearest. Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.52,1:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming. Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.56,1:10:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到餐车去喝一杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to the restaurant car, James, for that drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.61,1:10:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.48,1:10:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.45,1:10:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚一点再继续时装秀吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll continue the fashion show later.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.74,1:10:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切已安排妥当让我把车停下 我们会从餐车离开 在另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's arranged for me to stop the train. We'll get off at the restaurant car.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.91,1:10:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 六点整见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. We'll meet you there at six.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.08,1:10:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要晚一点才行 事情有点复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it just a little later. But there are complications.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.46,1:10:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏联特工宝士在火车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the Russian security men, Benz, he's on the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.05,1:10:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他上车前该没时间联络领事馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he wouldn't have had time to contact the consulate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.97,1:10:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来的两小时我会伴着他 直到是时候下车为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case, I'll keep him company until it's time to get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.89,1:11:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你要我给你介绍 很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'd like me to introduce you. Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.65,1:11:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ticket control.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.54,1:11:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别惊慌 朋友 我们会尽量使你舒服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not be alarmed. We will make you as comfortable as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.83,1:11:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以确定宝士部长的旅程 会更加安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm sure Commissar Benz will have a much safer journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.92,1:11:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没生他的裁缝的气吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not mad about his tailor, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯坦堡缺少了你 真的会不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, James, life in Istanbul will never be the same without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.68,1:11:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,餐车上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you in the restaurant car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.31,1:11:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这一生非常精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had a particularly fascinating life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.19,1:11:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有兴趣听听吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to hear about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.23,1:11:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有兴趣啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.75,1:12:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗?  喜欢 跟你很搭配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like it? Yes, it does rather suit you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.01,1:12:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把其他一切留到英国才穿 现在是下午四点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will save everything else for England. It is four o'clock, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.30,1:12:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在下午这样做不太好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not kulturny in the afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.68,1:12:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使在度蜜月也不行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even on a honeymoon?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.31,1:12:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就脱下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.81,1:12:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又再各执一词了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're talking at cross purposes again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.03,1:12:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮雅 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tania. Mm-hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.12,1:12:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是穿衣服吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better get dressed now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.79,1:12:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛? 快六点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? It's almost six.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.62,1:12:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.87,1:13:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午茶时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's teatime.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.59,1:13:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里喝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have it in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.84,1:13:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每餐都在这里吃吧 的确是好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have all our meals here. Yes, that would be splendid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.51,1:13:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我跟克林约好了在餐车见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've arranged to meet Kerim in the restaurant car.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.64,1:13:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己去吧 我留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go alone. I will stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.31,1:13:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的索美赛太太 我们是体面的英国夫妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Mrs Somerset, we're supposed to be a respectable English couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.98,1:13:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会到餐车喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would certainly have tea in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.52,1:13:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.53,1:13:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照我的说话办 好吗?  是的 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do as I say, will you? Yes, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.36,1:13:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有些英国习俗应该要改一改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there are some English customs that are going to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.66,1:13:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But of course, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的打扮妥当吗? 索美赛先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look right, Mr Somerset?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.23,1:14:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.32,1:14:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索美赛太太 真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs Somerset. How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.58,1:14:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索美赛太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Somerset. Mr Somerset.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.67,1:14:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克林贝的朋友吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the friend of Kerim Bey? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.08,1:14:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了可怕的状况了 请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a terrible accident. Please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.30,1:14:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喝茶了吗? 晚一点再喝吧 把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tea? Later. Keep the door locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.98,1:15:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们自伤残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.78,1:15:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到达翠亚思前 千万别泄露风声 这可是很困难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be kept quiet until Trieste. It will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.66,1:15:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.37,1:15:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林贝是大人物 结交不少权贵 我肯定他们也会酬谢你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim Bey had many influential friends. I'm sure they also will reward you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.76,1:15:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尝试的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will try.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.19,1:16:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.57,1:16:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林死了 死了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim's dead. Dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.28,1:16:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.28,1:16:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 你弄痛我了! 若你不说 我可以更狠心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, you are hurting me. I'll do worse if you don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.45,1:16:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奉命行事罢了 他们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing this under orders, I know. What are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.75,1:16:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂你在说什么? 骗子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you mean. Liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.96,1:16:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使你杀了我 我也没话可说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if you kill me, I can say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.92,1:17:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不晓得克林会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not know anything like Kerim's death would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.14,1:17:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 抵达伦敦后 我会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when we get to England, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.85,1:17:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续说吧 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.27,1:17:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们没把整个计划告诉你 不过快把你所知的都告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they didn't let you in on all of it, but whatever you do know, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.31,1:17:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道我爱你 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I love you, James. I love you. Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.65,1:17:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, I love you, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.57,1:17:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.30,1:17:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝尔格勒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belgrade. Belgrade.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.47,1:18:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以借一根火柴用吗? 我用打火机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I borrow a match? I use a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.76,1:18:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就更好了 直到它们坏掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better still. Until they go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.10,1:18:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家兄打了电话给我 火车为什么没停下来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother telephoned me. Why did the train not stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.23,1:18:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个坏消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I have some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.23,1:18:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.98,1:18:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁干的?告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.78,1:18:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经处理好了 对方先死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took care of that himself. The other man died first.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.36,1:18:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.53,1:19:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助去要越过 南斯拉夫和翠亚思的边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need help to get across the frontier between Yugoslavia and Trieste.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.08,1:19:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你转达口讯给伦敦的M\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to send a message to M in London:
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.58,1:19:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请他从Y分局派人前往扎格拉布 跟我见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to send someone from Station Y to meet me in Zagreb.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.13,1:19:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.50,1:19:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.76,1:19:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 我想你会想要这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'II... I think you'll want these.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.97,1:19:26.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边  谢谢 火车要开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur Somerset, le train part. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.08,1:22:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳许上尉 邦德化名索美赛上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Nash. Bond, travelling as Somerset.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.21,1:22:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My card.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.80,1:22:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛这么久才到? 很抱歉 我一小时前才收到M的电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kept you? I only got M's wire an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.09,1:22:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已尽快赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I busted every record getting here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.76,1:22:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M有什么指示? 他只是叫我跟你和那位女士联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were M's orders? To contact you and the lady on the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.31,1:22:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Come this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.56,1:22:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.36,1:22:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是内子凯罗琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my wife Caroline. Captain Nash.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.70,1:22:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do? I'm so pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.95,1:22:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边走 请坐  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Nash. Sit down, will you? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.71,1:23:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来了南斯拉夫很久吗? 三年左右吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been long in Yugoslavia? About three years.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.51,1:23:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作有趣吗?  有时吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting work? Yes, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.05,1:23:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道吧 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how it is, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.51,1:23:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很健壮呢 我努力维持身材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look very fit, Nash. Yes, I try to keep in shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.18,1:23:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's our problem, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.35,1:23:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能冒险带着这东西 在南斯拉夫和翠亚思边境过海关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't risk taking this through the customs at the Yugoslav-Trieste border.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.44,1:23:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再没中途站了 我们得跳车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No stops till then. We'd have to jump off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.57,1:23:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以帮忙吗? 这里有敌人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get us across? Any of the opposition around?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.20,1:23:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这方面你不用担心 好 我们办得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in any condition to worry about. Good. We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.29,1:23:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对这片土地了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this territory like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.50,1:23:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先吃点东西好吗? 我今天只吃过早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if we have a bite to eat? I've been on the go since breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.42,1:23:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把东西留在这里 我们去餐车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course not. We'll go to the restaurant car.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.34,1:23:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯罗琳 你陪纳许上尉到餐车去 我待会就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caroline, you go with Nash. I'll join you there in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.43,1:23:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就照你的说话办吧 老兄 借光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you say, old man. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.13,1:24:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.43,1:24:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.89,1:24:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还担心你出状况了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was worried something had happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.98,1:24:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问要几成熟？先生 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voil? monsieur. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.56,1:24:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.11,1:24:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要烤比目鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the grilled sole.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.07,1:25:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位女士也是 你要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for madam. What about you, Nash?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.20,1:25:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听来不错 要三份吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that sounds very nice. Make that three of those, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.20,1:25:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一瓶白酒  我要吉安地酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have a bottle of Blanc de Blancs. Make mine chianti.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.70,1:25:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉安地白酒? 不 是红酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White chianti? No, the red kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.83,1:25:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好享用吧 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, enjoy your dinner, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.13,1:25:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的问题有解决答案了 很简单的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the answer to our problems. Very simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.46,1:25:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.26,1:25:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时后就到达边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should reach the border in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.31,1:25:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很对不起 索美赛太太 我真是笨手笨脚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terribly sorry, Mrs Somerset. That was clumsy of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.10,1:25:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服务员 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiter. Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.77,1:25:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服务员 马上就来，先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiter. Tout de suite, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.82,1:25:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 谢谢 你会发觉翠亚思是个蛮有趣的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.  Merci. You'll find Trieste quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.58,1:25:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 总比不上伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, it's not London.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.75,1:26:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheerio. Cheerio.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.31,1:26:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.31,1:26:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.19,1:26:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太太要昏过去了 让她进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lady's come over faint. Bring her in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.11,1:26:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.41,1:26:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到隔壁去吧  我想她累坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go next door. Exhaustion, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.84,1:26:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么 你在她的饮料里下了什么药?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it, the stuff you put in her drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.46,1:26:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水合氯醛 快速见效 药性温和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chloral hydrate. Quick, but mild.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.97,1:26:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢? 放轻松 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And? Take it easy, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.55,1:27:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的逃亡路线只能带一个人走 你要那个女孩还是解码器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My escape route's only for one. What are you after, the girl or the Lektor?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.73,1:27:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.48,1:27:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么计划呢? 我用地图解释吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your plan? Explain it better on a map. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.78,1:27:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里 看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we're here, you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.00,1:27:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有一条陡坡 火车会慢下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we reach there, there's a steep gradient. The train slows down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.46,1:27:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们封锁这路线 走到大道去 在那里乘车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll block the line, make for that main road, pick up a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.05,1:27:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实那是一辆货车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A truck, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.88,1:27:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离这里必定有二十里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be about 20 miles from here...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.97,1:28:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.89,1:28:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跪下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, now. Get up on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.61,1:28:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手放在口袋里 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands in your pockets. Keep them there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.82,1:28:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用红酒来配鱼肉 我早该料到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red wine with fish. That should have told me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.45,1:28:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道喝哪种酒才适合 可是现在跪着的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may know the right wines, but you're the one on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.99,1:28:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it feel, old man?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.75,1:29:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄? 是你们在情报科的称号吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old man? Is that what you chaps in SMERSH call each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.42,1:29:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情报科?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SMERSH?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.88,1:29:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 是幽灵党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. SPECTRE.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.60,1:29:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来不是俄国在耍花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't a Russian show at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.01,1:29:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我们互相猜忌 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been playing us off against each other, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.19,1:29:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清真寺的俄国特工是幽灵党杀的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was SPECTRE who killed the Russian agent in the mosque.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.44,1:29:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你干的吧? 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.69,1:29:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克林和另外的人呢? 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kerim and the other man? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.11,1:29:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有纳什? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Nash?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.12,1:29:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mind talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.41,1:29:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着詹姆斯邦德 发现自己是个大蠢才 实在刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get a kick out of watching James Bond find out what a bloody fool he's been.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.21,1:29:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是内行呢 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pros, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.38,1:29:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在东京的同事临死前 把识别密码招供出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sweated your recognition code out of one of your men in Tokyo before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.51,1:29:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直密切监视着你 我一直是你的守护天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been keeping tabs on you. I've been your guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.39,1:30:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在吉普赛营中救了你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saved your life at the Gypsy camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.30,1:30:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是的 真是感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. I'm much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.02,1:30:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到解码器前 我们一直保着你的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were keeping you alive until you could get us the Lektor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.65,1:30:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我把它拱手奉上 真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you had me deliver it on a plate. That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.69,1:30:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续说吧 我听得很着迷呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. I'm fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.49,1:30:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然解码器已到手  你和那女子都可以牺牲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that we've got it, you and the girl are expendable.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.95,1:30:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里至翠亚思之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between here and Trieste.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.49,1:30:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.79,1:30:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是幽灵党的一份子吗? 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't she working for SPECTRE, too? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.71,1:30:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她以为自己在为祖国服务呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks she's doing it all for Mother Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.17,1:30:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她听从克莱普上校的指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She takes her orders from Colonel Klebb.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.80,1:30:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俄国人克莱普 情报科行动组组长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosa Klebb's Russian. Head of operations for SMERSH.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.51,1:30:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.59,1:30:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是幽灵党的人了 那女孩并不知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klebb works for SPECTRE now. The girl doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.56,1:30:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何还要把她干掉? 这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why kill her? Orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.23,1:31:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划还不只于此的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's only half of it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.65,1:31:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有一卷胶卷 将会在她的手袋里出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a roll of film. She'll have this in her handbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.11,1:31:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这封信则会在你身上出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on you, they'll find this letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.20,1:31:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她写的 说因她帮过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from her, threatening to give the film to the press
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.75,1:31:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而必须娶她 否则她就公开这影片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you marry her for helping you get the Lektor.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.54,1:31:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么影片呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What film?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.58,1:31:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你下榻的结婚套房里拍下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taken in the bridal suite at your hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.42,1:31:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩和你都懵然不知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something else the girl didn't know about. Or you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.88,1:31:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有变态的才能想出这种计策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be a pretty sick collection of minds to dream up a plan like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.47,1:31:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以想像到头条吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you see the headlines?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.23,1:31:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"英国特工谋杀俄国女特工 自戕而死"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"British agent murders beautiful Russian spy, then commits suicide."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.56,1:31:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 你是从哪所疯人院中逃出来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, which lunatic asylum did they get you out of?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.48,1:31:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别为难自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make it tougher on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.86,1:31:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的指示是把你干掉 把解码器运送回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My orders are to kill you and deliver the Lektor.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.28,1:31:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用什么方式由我作主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How I do it is my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.08,1:32:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会觉得痛不欲生 他们给了你多少报酬? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be slow and painful. How much are they paying you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.96,1:32:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关你什么事? 我们把酬金加倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it to you? We'll double it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.50,1:32:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢用名誉担保吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your word of honour?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.51,1:32:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国绅士的名誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As an English gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.18,1:32:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一枪不会干掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first one won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.77,1:32:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二枪也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the second.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.39,1:32:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三枪也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the third.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.69,1:32:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直至你爬过来吻我的脚 我才会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not till you crawl over here and you kiss my foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.45,1:32:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我一支烟好吗? 你休想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a cigarette? Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.78,1:32:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.04,1:32:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什么付呢? 五十个一镑金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What with? 50 gold sovereigns.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.71,1:32:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪? 在上面 我的皮箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they? Up there, in my case.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.18,1:33:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.19,1:33:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你 香烟在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are. What about that cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.44,1:33:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那些东西放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw 'em down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.74,1:33:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他公事包里还有吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more in the other case?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.58,1:33:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该有 那是个标准配备 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should imagine so. It's standard kit. I'll have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.21,1:33:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手放回口袋里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands back in your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.00,1:33:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别伸出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep them there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.18,1:36:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要这个的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be needing this...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.39,1:36:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.32,1:36:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮雅 快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tania. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.99,1:36:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快起来 否则我不管你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, or I'll leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.08,1:36:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮雅 快起来 否则我不管你了 你听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tania, wake up or I'll leave you behind, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.71,1:36:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我 永远不要离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me. Never leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.55,1:36:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮雅 这是纳许的逃走路线 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tania, this is Nash's escape route. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.18,1:36:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得从这下车 拿着 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get off here. Take this. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.23,1:37:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要走到火车的另一边 到下面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must get to the other side of the train. Under here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.19,1:37:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,葛兰 你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grant, where are you? Grant?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.70,1:38:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.19,1:38:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.73,1:38:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.82,1:38:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点!否则我把你留在这里 跟我一起留下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, or I'll leave you here. Stay here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.58,1:39:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里躺一下吧 早上就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep it off in there. You'll feel better in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.71,1:39:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.77,1:40:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把货车轰掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and straddle the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.91,1:40:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去引开他们 你躲到货车下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get them away from here. You hide under the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.10,1:42:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确定他们一架飞机失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say one of their aircraft is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.66,1:42:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tania.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.37,1:42:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着 把绳索解开 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, take this, and cast the rope off. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.79,1:42:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the key? Where's the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.05,1:42:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外套的口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my coat. In the pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.97,1:43:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来 快点 上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get out. Move. In the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.11,1:43:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会游泳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you swim?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.49,1:43:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来掌舵 请到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the wheel. This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.41,1:43:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心阶梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind the step.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.04,1:43:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你真倒霉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just isn't your day, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.51,1:43:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要到哪去呢? 威尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going? Venice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.51,1:43:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看那储物柜内有什么 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at that locker, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.05,1:43:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有航海图、手枪和几枚照明弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charts, pistol, some flares.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.85,1:43:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,航海图给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me those charts.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.40,1:44:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们在此 伊斯特里亚附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we're here, near Istria.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.11,1:44:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多燃料 走运的话 明早就会到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got plenty of fuel. With luck we should be there by morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.66,1:44:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翠亚思的火车上发现了三具尸体 其中一个是葛兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three man were found dead on the train at Trieste. One of them was Grant.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.04,1:44:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五号 你有什么高见呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you to say, Number Five?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.21,1:44:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是克莱普的人选 她的手下失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was Klebb's choice. Her people failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.33,1:44:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是策划人 他们只是奉命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was your plan. They followed it implicitly.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.51,1:44:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没可能的 计划完美无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible. It was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.17,1:44:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了一件事 他们要对付的是邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for one thing: They were dealing with Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.01,1:44:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟克朗斯汀比起来 邦德是什么东西啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Bond compared with Kronsteen?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.14,1:44:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点没错 你有何高见 三号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. What have you to say to that, Number Three?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.94,1:44:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德还没死 解码器还没到手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond is still alive and the Lektor is not yet in our possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.90,1:44:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟俄国人协议了 要把它归还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have already negotiated with the Russians to return it to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.86,1:44:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,价钱也谈好了 幽灵党是言出必行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've agreed a price. And SPECTRE always delivers what it promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.91,1:45:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,组织的兴亡 在于我们能否遵守诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our whole organisation depends on our keeping those promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.46,1:45:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾警告过你 我们不会容忍失败 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you. We do not tolerate failure, 
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.54,1:45:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三号 你知道惩罚是什么了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Three. You know the penalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.34,1:45:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道 一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.59,1:45:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的规矩很简单 若你失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our rules are very simple. If you fail...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.27,1:45:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十二秒 终有一天要发明更快见效的毒液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}12 seconds. One day we must invent a faster-working venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.28,1:45:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三号 是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Three. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.61,1:45:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望跟俄国人说 还要再延期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not wish to tell the Russians there will be another delay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.20,1:45:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会延期的了 还有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no delay, Number One. There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.17,1:45:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要走哪条路? 最短的一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way are we going? The shortest route.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.18,1:46:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过那两座山 沿着海岸直驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is between those two mountains and straight along the coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.44,1:46:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahoy, Mr Bond. Ahoy, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.11,1:46:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave to. Heave to.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.05,1:46:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经被包围了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trapped, Mr Bond. You're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.72,1:46:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不掉的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot escape. You cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.39,1:46:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪榴弹队 准备开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.94,1:47:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要穿过来了! 绿色幽灵 让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming through. Pull over, SPECTRE Green. Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.28,1:47:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让路 开枪警告他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give them a warning shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.99,1:47:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪榴弹队 开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rifle grenade, fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.66,1:47:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机关枪队 开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forward machine gun, fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.62,1:47:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红色幽灵 射击的距离太近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're firing too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.58,1:47:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色幽灵 射击的距离太近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SPECTRE Red, SPECTRE Green, you're firing too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.21,1:47:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要拦截 而不是击沉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to stop them, not to sink them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.31,1:47:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来掌舵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.86,1:47:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.70,1:47:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有船只 慢下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down. Slow down all boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.58,1:48:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色 我们掩护你 开到他们的旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green, go alongside while we keep you covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.54,1:48:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来 邦德先生!  你干嘛要放弃呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.09,1:48:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有油桶 可以开快一点  手枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without the drums we can go faster. Hand me the Very pistol.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.30,1:48:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别放下手 我们派船来接你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands up. We're sending a boat along to take you off.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.73,1:48:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国有句谚语说:有烟必有火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a saying in England, "Where there's smoke, there's fire."
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.70,1:48:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色幽灵 快改变航道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green, change your course. Go astern.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.66,1:48:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有船只 快把火药抛弃! 快离开船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All boats, throw out your ammunition. Get rid of it, quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.04,1:48:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.84,1:49:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.28,1:49:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.94,1:49:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.57,1:49:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.24,1:49:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 叫他等等 可以吗? 请你派服务员来搬行李 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thanks. Tell him to wait, will you? And send up a porter for the luggage.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.58,1:49:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avanti.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.75,1:49:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以整理了吗 夫人? 可以啊 请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permesso, signore? Si Prego.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.25,1:49:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 把电话接到英国领事 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And also get me the British Consul. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.03,1:50:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找麦斯威尔先生 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? Oh, Mr Maxwell, please. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.49,1:50:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 我们要错过班机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, we will miss the plane. And we will...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.28,1:50:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是保罗吗? 我是邦德 我们快要走了 我想向你道谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Paul? Bond here. I wanted to thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.16,1:50:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请通知公司说我我们要回来了 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal the office we're on our way back, will you? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.09,1:50:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动那个 我自己会拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, leave that. I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.25,1:50:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？哦 不 余下的只是例行公事罢了 很多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Oh, no. Should be routine from here on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.64,1:50:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么? 克莱普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, what was that you were saying? Klebb.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.68,1:50:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 你还在吗? 喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, you still there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.98,1:50:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼诺娃 开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romanova, the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.82,1:50:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼诺娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romanova!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.84,1:51:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.23,1:52:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怕的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horrible woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.19,1:52:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 她的脚劲还真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. She's had her kicks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.21,1:52:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你 它可能会再派上用场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are. In case you ever need it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.92,1:52:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 必须对政府公物负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. All government property has to be accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.47,1:52:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但正如我所说过的 我们不见得要在办公时间内合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I said before, we won't always work on the company's time, will we?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.51,1:52:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.98,1:53:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你检点一点 有人在拍摄我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, behave yourself. We are being filmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.94,1:53:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 别再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.28,1:53:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没说谎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.58,1:53:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?  我示范给你看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? I'll show you.
